<h2>Starting and Managing Conversations</h2>

<p>
    <strong>To start a new conversation:</strong>
</p>

<ol>
    <li>Click the <strong>"New"</strong> button in the chat panel</li>
    <li>Select the channel (Staff, Web, or SMS)</li>
    <li>Choose or enter the recipient</li>
    <li>Type your message and send</li>
</ol>

<p>
    <strong>Working with conversations:</strong>
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Type messages</strong> – Just type and press Enter to send</li>
    <li><strong>Paste content</strong> – Copy and paste text from anywhere</li>
    <li><strong>Attach files</strong> – Drop files into the chat to share documents</li>
    <li><strong>View history</strong> – All conversations stay in the list so you can reopen them anytime</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Conversations persist even after you close them, so you can always come back to continue the discussion.
</p>

