<h2>Unread Counts and Notifications</h2>

<p>
    Each chat tab shows an unread count badge when there are new messages:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Red badge with number</strong> – Shows how many unread messages you have</li>
    <li><strong>Easy navigation</strong> – Click the tab to see unread messages</li>
    <li><strong>Stay informed</strong> – Badges help you know where to look first</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Unread counts update in real time, so you'll know immediately when new messages arrive.
</p>

